  m_Name: Lore10
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_10
  title: The Base Of The Mountain
  fullText: 'This is new.

    I have never been here before.


    Yet...

    This
    mountain

    I remember it.


    The fog in my mind begins to clear.

    I
    am starting to remember.


    Yet something uneasy lingers.

    I cannot remember
    what lies ahead.


    Remember the cards.

    Remember the families.

    Remember
    your past mistakes.


    Now...

    Focus on the future not the past.'
